  <h2 class="h-section mt-4" data-reveal>The paper</h2>

  <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="card p-8" data-reveal>
      <h3 class="eyebrow mb-4">Abstract</h3>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream-dim">
        We present Quack-1, an open-weight rubber duck for interactive program repair and gloriously
        unnecessary research. Quack-1 faithfully reproduces key duck behaviors — patient listening,
        perfect buoyancy, and passive judgment under everyday debugging conditions. We report baseline
        results on BathBench, a standardized evaluation suite conducted in a single bathtub and very
        possibly rigged by us. Limitations include heavy dependency on gravity, desks, and human
        self-awareness.
      </p>
      <h3 class="eyebrow mt-8 mb-4">Peer review</h3>
